<title>NETHERLANDS: Thomassen Jan-Sept 1996 profit falls.</title>
<headline>Thomassen Jan-Sept 1996 profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First nine months of 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     8.5  vs  10.4</p>
<p>    Revenues			     324.4  vs 391.1</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    13.0  vs  14.6</p>
<p>Note - Dutch gas Turbine maker Thomassen International Holding BV is fully owned by German Babcock AG  </p>
<p>Thomassen said the value of its order book increased to 913 million guilders at the end of September 1996 from 639 million guilders at the end of 1995.</p>
